dc4ab788edd","question":"<p>2. Social media ensures that people feel less lonely than before. </p>","answers":["<p>False</p>","<p>True</p>"]},{"subContentId":"9e799dd6-3f48-4d28-b961-546a3c0a9523","question":"<p>3. One advantage of social media is that it makes it easier to stay connected with others.</p>","answers":["<p>True</p>","<p>False</p>"]},{"subContentId":"433b1672-f936-406f-86a8-68ea98d77233","question":"<p>4. Social media can be addictive because it is constantly updated by users.</p>","answers":["<p>True</p>","<p>False</p>"]},{"subContentId":"ab5e664f-94dc-4199-84c8-16a008d0c486","question":"<p>5. Experts think the constant updates on social media are a reason it can be addictive.</p>","answers":["<p>True</p>","<p>False</p>"]},{"subContentId":"d5c1311b-b949-4ef5-bc60-bf9a40b1fc28","question":"<p>6. It is easy to stop scrolling on social media because it rarely updates.</p>","answers":["<p>False</p>","<p>True</p>"]},{"subContentId":"64974175-5bd8-4098-88db-ce84efe27233","question":"<p>7. Embarrassing photos uploaded online can stay there forever. </p>","answers":["<p>True</p>","<p>False</p>"]},{"subContentId":"ffbbea92-56a1-43c0-a616-ca96cc97ab39","question":"<p>8. We should enjoy social media but also be careful about what we post. </p>","answers":["<p>True</p>","<p>False</p>"]},{"subContentId":"60ebb1e1-1767-497f-8955-222f9ff80bbd","question":"<p>9. Anything uploaded on social media can potentially be seen by anyone, at any time.</p>","answers":["<p>True</p>","<p>False</p>"]},{"subContentId":"ef041e65-74b4-4549-90ea-4c1e0d0a093d","question":"<p>10. Social media only have positive effects on your life</p>","answers":["<p>False</p>","<p>True</p>"]}],"overallFeedback":[{"from":0,"to":100}],"behaviour":{"autoContinue":true,"timeoutCorrect":2000,"timeoutWrong":3000,"soundEffectsEnabled":true,"enableRetry":false,"enableSolutionsButton":false,"passPercentage":100},"l10n":{"nextButtonLabel":"Next question","showSolutionButtonLabel":"Show solution","retryButtonLa